of virus from skin lesions.</article-title><source>S Afr Med J</source> <year>1963</year>;<volume>37</volume>:<fpage>547</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">13932506</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Zhou</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Liang</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Li</surname> <given-names>L</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Complete nucleotide sequence of the nonstructural gene of alphavirus YN87448 strain isolated in China and its relationship to other Sindbis viruses</article-title><comment>[in Chinese]</comment> <source>Zhonghua Shi Yan He Lin Chuang Bing Du Xue Za Zhi</source> <year>1999</year>;<volume>13</volume>:<fpage>314</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12759966</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R14"><label>14. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Kurkela</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Manni</surname> <given-names>T</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vaheri</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vapalahti</surname> <given-names>O</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Causative agent of Pogosta disease isolated from blood and skin lesions.</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source> <year>2004</year>;<volume>10</volume>:<fpage>889</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15200824</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Boughton</surname> <given-names>CR</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hawkes</surname> <given-names>RA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Naim</surname> <given-names>HM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Wild</surname> <given-names>J</give